#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_26_432341d7
msgid ""
"Has the auditor obtained an understanding of how management monitors "
"internal control over financial reporting?"
msgstr "Apakah auditor memperoleh pemahaman tentang bagaimana manajemen memantau pengendalian internal atas pelaporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_23_08215f1c
msgid ""
"Has the auditor obtained an understanding of how the information system "
"captures events and conditions (other than transactions) that are "
"significant to the financial statements?"
msgstr "Apakah auditor memahami bagaimana sistem informasi menangkap kejadian dan kondisi (selain transaksi) yang signifikan bagi laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_22_1cc148f7
msgid ""
"Has the auditor obtained an understanding of the accounting records, "
"supporting information, and specific accounts in the financial statements "
"used to initiate, record, process, and report transactions. This includes "
"corrections of erroneous information and how the information is transferred "
"to the general ledger?"
msgstr "Apakah auditor memahami catatan akuntansi, informasi pendukung, dan akun spesifik dalam laporan keuangan yang digunakan untuk memulai, mencatat, memproses, dan melaporkan transaksi termasuk koreksi informasi salah serta bagaimana informasi ditransfer ke buku besar umum?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_20_6afd023a
msgid ""
"Has the auditor obtained an understanding of the classes of transactions in "
"the entity's operations that are significant to the financial statements?"
msgstr "Apakah auditor memahami kelas transaksi dalam operasi entitas yang signifikan bagi laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_24_82acd9fc
msgid ""
"Has the auditor obtained an understanding of the financial reporting process"
" used to prepare the entity's financial statements, including significant "
"accounting estimates and disclosures?"
msgstr "Apakah auditor memahami proses pelaporan keuangan yang digunakan untuk menyiapkan laporan keuangan entitas termasuk estimasi dan pengungkapan akuntansi signifikan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_21_114f1802
msgid ""
"Has the auditor obtained an understanding of the procedures, both in "
"information technology and manual, by which transactions are initiated, "
"recorded, processed and corrected as appropriate, transferred to the general"
" ledger, and reported in the financial statements?"
msgstr "Apakah auditor memahami prosedur, baik TI maupun manual, untuk memulai, mencatat, memproses dan mengoreksi transaksi, mentransfer ke buku besar umum, serta melaporkannya dalam laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_6_44c12a99
msgid ""
"Has the client's organizational structure been designed to effectively "
"achieve the client's objectives? This includes planning, implementation, "
"control, and supervision."
msgstr "Apakah struktur organisasi klien dirancang efektif mencapai tujuan klien termasuk perencanaan, pelaksanaan, pengendalian, dan supervisi?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_7_ec575f1d
msgid ""
"Has there been a proper division of tasks and authority regarding "
"operational activities, reporting, and authorization?"
msgstr "Apakah terdapat pembagian tugas dan wewenang yang tepat terkait aktivitas operasional, pelaporan, dan otorisasi?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_ws_b59b886_view_form
msgid ""
"Have any significant deficiencies been identified, either individually or in"
" combination ?"
msgstr "Apakah ada kekurangan signifikan teridentifikasi, secara individual atau kombinasi?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_13_185eb854
msgid ""
"Have business risks relevant to the financial reporting objectives been "
"identified and how are they addressed?"
msgstr "Apakah risiko bisnis relevan dengan tujuan pelaporan keuangan telah diidentifikasi dan bagaimana penanganannya?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk
#: model:general_audit_general_control_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_control_risk.general_audit_general_control_indicator_16_1ca884bd
msgid ""
"Have the transactions that occurred been authorized by management in "
"accordance with their authority?"
msgstr "Apakah transaksi yang terjadi telah diotorisasi oleh manajemen sesuai kewenangannya?"

